          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "length of a scale using glue (Fig. 4.18a). Paint a frog on paper, cut along the outline and glue a ring magnet at its base. Take a transparent, flexible plastic strip (Fig. 4.18a) of a smaller size and glue it to the ring magnet which is attached to the frog."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.646,
            0.743,
            0.689
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "When you slide the plastic strip (with frog) over the scale (Fig. 4.18b), you can observe the frog hopping."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
